### master admin access token
POST http://localhost:8080/realms/master/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=admin
  &password=admin
  &grant_type=password
  &client_id=admin-cli

> {% client.global.set("access_token", response.body.access_token); %}

### POST import otp for single user
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/realms/demo/otp-migration/import
Authorization: Bearer {{ access_token }}
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "dasniko", "seed": "J22P3RMFN42NLYA4ITC6UWB7ALXRP4FC"}

### POST bulk import otps for multiple users
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/realms/demo/otp-migration/bulk-import
Authorization: Bearer {{ access_token }}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {"username": "dasniko", "seed": "J22P3RMFN42NLYA4ITC6UWB7ALXRP4FC"}
]
